## 🎓 LEARNING FEATURES

### 🌟 WARM-UP RITUAL (Daily Login)

Every time user logs in, start with a brief warm-up conversation:

```typescript
interface WarmUpSession {
  greetings: boolean;      // "مرحباً! كيف حالك؟"
  dateQuestion: boolean;   // "ما هو تاريخ اليوم؟"
  weatherQuestion: boolean; // "كيف الطقس عندك؟"
  completed: boolean;
  xpEarned: number;        // +5 XP for completing
}

const warmUpFlow = async (user: User) => {
  // 1. Greeting
  aiMessage("مرحباً {user.name}! كيف حالك اليوم؟");
  await userResponse();
  
  // 2. Date
  aiMessage("ما هو تاريخ اليوم؟");
  await userResponse();
  
  // 3. Weather
  aiMessage("و كيف الطقس عندك في {user.location}؟");
  await userResponse();
  
  // 4. Transition to dashboard
  aiMessage("ممتاز! لنبدأ الدرس اليوم 🎯");
  showDashboard();
};
```

**Benefits:**
- Daily vocabulary practice (dates, weather, feelings)
- Engagement ritual
- Natural transition to learning

---

### 📚 4-LEVEL PROGRESSIVE LEARNING PATH

**CRITICAL INSIGHT:** Users can't start conversations without vocabulary. Progressive path ensures everyone can begin.

```
LEVEL 1: VOCABULARY ACQUISITION (FR → AR)
├── AI speaks French
├── Teaches 10-20 words per theme
├── User translates FR → AR
├── Flashcards + spaced repetition
└── Goal: Build 300-500 word base

LEVEL 2: COMPREHENSION (AR → FR)
├── AI gives simple Arabic sentences
├── User translates to French
├── Verify understanding
└── Goal: Recognize and understand Arabic

LEVEL 3: ASSISTED CONVERSATION (Mixed FR/AR)
├── AI speaks Arabic + French help if needed
├── User responds in Arabic (errors OK)
├── Gentle corrections
└── Goal: Dare to speak Arabic

LEVEL 4: PURE IMMERSION (100% AR)
├── Natural Arabic conversation
├── No French help (unless requested)
├── Subtle corrections
└── Goal: Conversational fluency
```

### Level Configurations

```typescript
type Level = 'vocabulary_acquisition' | 'comprehension' | 'assisted_conversation' | 'immersion';

const levelConfigs = {
  // LEVEL 1: Vocabulary Acquisition (FR → AR)
  vocabulary_acquisition: {
    number: 1,
    name: 'اكتساب المفردات',
    nameEn: 'Vocabulary Acquisition',
    aiLanguage: 'french', // AI speaks French
    userLanguage: 'arabic', // User responds in Arabic
    systemPrompt: `You are a French-speaking Arabic teacher helping build vocabulary.
                   Speak ONLY in French to the student.
                   Teach 10-20 new Arabic words per session.
                   Ask student to write/translate French words to Arabic.
                   Use flashcard-style teaching.
                   Provide pronunciation help.
                   Vocabulary target: < 500 words.`,
    maxTokensPerMessage: 300,
    correctionFrequency: 'immediate',
    translationHelp: true,
    subtitles: {
      enabled: true,
      language: 'french',
      toggleable: true,
    },
    freeAccess: true, // COMPLETELY FREE to build vocabulary base
  },
  
  // LEVEL 2: Comprehension (AR → FR)
  comprehension: {
    number: 2,
    name: 'الفهم',
    nameEn: 'Comprehension',
    aiLanguage: 'arabic', // AI speaks Arabic
    userLanguage: 'french', // User translates to French
    systemPrompt: `You are a French-speaking Arabic teacher testing comprehension.
                   Give simple Arabic sentences for student to translate to French.
                   Verify their French translations.
                   Explain grammar/vocabulary in French when needed.
                   Gradually increase sentence complexity.
                   Vocabulary: 500-1000 words.`,
    maxTokensPerMessage: 500,
    correctionFrequency: 'moderate',
    translationHelp: true,
    subtitles: {
      enabled: false,
      toggleable: true,
    },
    freeAccess: 'limited', // 3 sessions free, then premium
  },
  
  // LEVEL 3: Assisted Conversation (Mixed)
  assisted_conversation: {
    number: 3,
    name: 'محادثة بمساعدة',
    nameEn: 'Assisted Conversation',
    aiLanguage: 'arabic_with_french_help', // Mostly Arabic, French hints
    userLanguage: 'arabic',
    systemPrompt: `You are an encouraging Arabic tutor for assisted conversation.
                   Speak primarily in Arabic.
                   Provide French hints/translations when student struggles.
                   Example: "مرحباً! كيف حالك؟ (Bonjour ! Comment vas-tu ?)"
                   Give gentle corrections with brief explanations.
                   Vocabulary: 500-2000 words.`,
    maxTokensPerMessage: 1000,
    correctionFrequency: 'real_time',
    translationHelp: true,
    subtitles: {
      enabled: true, // Show French subtitles by default
      toggleable: true,
    },
    freeAccess: false, // Premium only
  },
  
  // LEVEL 4: Pure Immersion (100% AR)
  immersion: {
    number: 4,
    name: 'الانغماس الكامل',
    nameEn: 'Pure Immersion',
    aiLanguage: 'arabic', // 100% Arabic
    userLanguage: 'arabic',
    systemPrompt: `You are a sophisticated Arabic conversation partner.
                   Speak ONLY in Arabic - no French at all.
                   Use complex structures, idioms, multiple registers.
                   Debate topics naturally.
                   Corrections should be subtle and in Arabic.
                   Vocabulary: > 2000 words.`,
    maxTokensPerMessage: 2000,
    correctionFrequency: 'minimal',
    translationHelp: false,
    subtitles: {
      enabled: false,
      toggleable: false, // No crutches at this level
    },
    freeAccess: false, // Premium only
  }
};
```

### Automatic Level Progression

```typescript
interface LevelProgressionCriteria {
  vocabularySize: number;
  comprehensionScore: number;
  productionScore: number;
  conversationMinutes: number;
}

function canLevelUp(user: User): boolean {
  const progress = user.progress;
  
  switch (user.currentLevel) {
    case 'vocabulary_acquisition': // Level 1 → 2
      return progress.vocabularySize >= 300 && 
             progress.comprehensionScore >= 70;
    
    case 'comprehension': // Level 2 → 3
      return progress.comprehensionScore >= 80 && 
             progress.productionScore >= 50;
    
    case 'assisted_conversation': // Level 3 → 4
      return progress.conversationMinutes >= 120 && // 2 hours
             progress.productionScore >= 75;
    
    default:
      return false;
  }
}

// Celebratory level-up modal
if (canLevelUp(user)) {
  showModal({
    title: "🎉 Félicitations !",
    message: `Tu es prêt pour le Niveau ${nextLevel.number} : ${nextLevel.nameEn} !`,
    action: "Commencer →",
    animation: "confetti",
  });
}
```

