### Conversion Funnel Strategy

```
User Journey:
1. Sign up → Start Level 1 (FREE, unlimited)
2. Complete 300 words → Level 2 unlocked (3 sessions free teaser)
3. After 3 Level 2 sessions → Paywall modal
   "🎉 Tu progresses bien ! Débloque Level 3 pour pratiquer la conversation"
4. Subscribe → Full access Levels 3 & 4

Conversion triggers:
- After completing 3 Level 2 sessions (teaser exhausted)
- When user tries to access Level 3 (conversation)
- When user tries to enable voice mode
- When user tries to access Darija
- When user tries to play interactive story
```

